
=== Riepilogo configurazione ===

✅ Controllo topologia: LAN e subnet coerenti.
✅ Controlli: nessuna dimenticanza trovata.

as1r1 (AS1)   [bgp]
  network BGP: 10.1.0.0/30, 1.20.0.0/30, 1.0.0.0/8
  10.1.0.1        as10r1     AS10    eBGP  nessuna policy
  1.20.0.2        as20r2     AS20    eBGP  nessuna policy

as2r1 (AS2)   [bgp rip]
  RIP: 2.0.0.0/8   redistribute connected
  network BGP: 2.20.4.4/30, 2.0.0.0/8
