--- Host e server ---
pc        host  10.0.0.2/24 (LAN P)   gw 10.0.0.1 (as10r1)   resolver 1.0.0.2 (ns_local)
web_srv   www   2.2.0.2/24 (LAN A)   gw 2.2.0.3 (as2r3)   apache2 avviato
ns_com    dns   20.1.0.3/24 (LAN G)   gw 20.1.0.1 (as20r1)   zone: . (hint), com (master)
ns_local  dns   1.0.0.2/24 (LAN N)   gw 1.0.0.1 (as1r1)   zone: . (hint)
root      dns   20.3.0.2/24 (LAN H)   gw 20.3.0.3 (as20r3)   zone: . (master)
                delega com -> dns.com 20.1.0.3 (ns_com)

Controlla ogni frase del testo: filtri (deny), preferenze (local-preference), MED (metric), network annunciate, costi OSPF, gateway e resolver dei pc, deleghe DNS.

